<title>USA: CBOT soy products end mostly lower on soy slide.</title>
<headline>CBOT soy products end mostly lower on soy slide.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>CBOT soy product futures closed lower following a late drop in soybean futures, traders said.</p>
<p>Late fund and technical selling drove the soy complex lower, they said.</p>
<p>Soyoil closed unchanged to 0.18 cent per lb lower with October at 22.63 cent per lb and October soymeal closed at $236.30 per ton.</p>
<p>Sam Nelson 312-408-8721</p>
